e allowlist/ceilings as a bounded change; this ticket tracks the real remedy.\n\n## What\nSplit along the existing call-graph seam: extract the repair cluster (`_repair_plan`, `_repair_ticket`, `_repair_run`, `_disable_schedule`/`_enable_schedule`) into a sibling `src/rebar/_commands/fsck_repair.py`, leaving the diagnostic scan + `_transform_json` in `fsck.py`. Both halves must stay above the 100-LOC floor. Then graduate `fsck.py` off `.github/module-size-allowlist.txt` + `module-size-ceilings.txt` and remove its `docs/architecture.md` remedy row.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `_commands/fsck.py` drops back under 800 LOC and is removed from the allowlist + ceilings files.\n- [ ] Repair functionality unchanged (fsck --repair behaves identically); `make lint && make typecheck && make test` pass.\n- [ ] No file created under 100 LOC by the split.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"215cbe21-01fc-443e-aeef-fe81f9da4f93","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"deleted","tags":[],"ticket_id":"69a9-b7fc-3b78-4142","ticket_type":"task","title":"Split _commands/fsck.py repair cluster into fsck_repair.py (module-size)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["c6eeb536-d460-42ee-a7a6-5c2795d28d08","215cbe21-01fc-443e-aeef-fe81f9da4f93","9e56bab7-67ff-4569-bd21-1b89e3863b7b"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659615527907001,"uuid":"7045eb85-e335-449f-8067-f94b4ffe29a8"}